        1575,
        1531,
        1689
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "b. Supervise and coordinate the operations of the Mayor's Office of Operations, the Office of City Legislative Affairs, the Office of State Legislative Affairs, and the Mayor's Office in Washington, D.C.",
