        1531,
        2077
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "c. Act on behalf of the Mayor, either directly or through the Office of City Legislative Affairs, the Office of State Legislative Affairs, or the Mayor's Office in Washington, D.C., with respect to all City, State and federal legislative matters affecting the City; direct the activities of the Mayor's legislative representatives in New York City, Albany, and Washington, D.C.; represent the Mayor before City Council, Congressional and State legislative committees; and maintain liaison with the Office of the President and all federal departments and agencies, the Office of the Governor and all State departments and agencies, and the City Council.",
